{"id":242170,"bangumiId":242170,"type":2,"name":"オーバーロードⅢ","name_cn":"OVERLORD 第三季","date":"2018-07-10","year":"2018","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg"},"summary":"时间为2138年。曾卷起一大风潮的虚拟现实体感型网络游戏《YGGDRASIL》即将迎来停服。玩家飞鼠在曾经以同伴和荣华自傲的根据地纳萨力克地下大坟墓，独自一人安静等待着那一刻。但是，不料发生了“过了结束时间却还没有登出”的异常事态。NPC们开始以自己的意志行动，不止如此，纳萨力克之外展开了从未见过的异世界。飞鼠为了寻找过去的同伴，以公会名安兹·乌尔·恭自称，决定在异世界扬名立万。他与宣誓绝对忠诚的部下一同，向新的地域进军。","rating":{"rank":5959,"total":9896,"count":{"1":81,"2":53,"3":114,"4":344,"5":1094,"6":3467,"7":3304,"8":1079,"9":165,"10":195},"score":6.4},"collection":{"on_hold":218,"dropped":283,"wish":683,"collect":19163,"doing":471},"tags":[{"name":"MADHouse","count":1442,"total_count":112773},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1363,"total_count":511899},{"name":"2018年7月","count":1259,"total_count":26573},{"name":"骨傲天","count":1192,"total_count":5894},{"name":"异世界","count":1153,"total_count":275748},{"name":"穿越","count":1146,"total_count":66326},{"name":"TV","count":960,"total_count":1453800},{"name":"奇幻","count":956,"total_count":495865},{"name":"OVERLORD","count":647,"total_count":3679},{"name":"装逼","count":547,"total_count":9430},{"name":"轻改","count":545,"total_count":156579},{"name":"龙傲天","count":539,"total_count":40939},{"name":"2018","count":477,"total_count":79665},{"name":"战斗","count":254,"total_count":493680},{"name":"网游","count":254,"total_count":14535},{"name":"小说改","count":190,"total_count":169378},{"name":"日本","count":121,"total_count":319082},{"name":"第三季","count":96,"total_count":1589},{"name":"续作","count":59,"total_count":48757},{"name":"伊藤尚往","count":57,"total_count":547},{"name":"搞笑","count":41,"total_count":660312},{"name":"后宫","count":30,"total_co